        <mxCell id="note" value="&lt;b&gt;Modeling convention.&lt;/b&gt; Each lane is a role responsible for its activities. The &lt;b&gt;System&lt;/b&gt; lane is included only to show the automated processing performed by ALAP: checking conditions, validating data, evaluating eligibility, saving information, updating status and sending notifications. Actor lanes contain only human work: entering data, selecting information, viewing results and making decisions that need human judgement. External lanes are services outside ALAP. Numbers match the activity table of this flow in the report." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#999999;fontSize=15;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0.0" y="534.0" width="1878.0" height="130.0" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
